[Info   :Neutron3529.Aux] 锤炼法:
from:(宝石)x2 + 细绳(string)x2 + 碎片(fragment)x2  to:棒 with:法杖
from:(锭)x1 + 树枝(branch)x1 + 藤蔓(vine)x1  to:石料 with:箭矢
from:(锭)x1 + 棒(stick)x1  to:石料 with:弩矢
from:(石料)x4 + 细绳(string)x2  to:厚板 with:回旋镖
from:(锭)x4 + 细绳(string)x2  to:厚板 with:回旋镖
from:(纤维)x4 + 花(flower)x8  to:草 with:花冠
from:(布料)x4 + 花(flower)x8  to:草 with:花冠
from:(纤维)x5 + 针(needle)x2  to:草 with:轻手套
from:(布料)x5 + 针(needle)x2  to:草 with:轻手套
from:(纤维)x3 + 树皮(bark)x4 + 细绳(string)x2  to:草 with:鞋子
from:(布料)x3 + 树皮(bark)x4 + 细绳(string)x2  to:草 with:鞋子
from:(纤维)x4 + 花(flower)x8  to:草 with:圣夜花冠
from:(布料)x4 + 花(flower)x8  to:草 with:圣夜花冠
from:(身体部件(类别))x1  to:肉(类别) with:鱼饵
from:(蘑菇(类别))x1  to:肉(类别) with:鱼饵
